{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22407","headline":"初出蓝田路作 · 白居易","name":"初出蓝田路作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"停骖问前路，路在秋云里。\n苍苍县南道，去途从此始。\n绝顶忽上盘，衆山皆下视。\n下视千万峰，峰头如浪起。\n朝经韩公坡，夕次蓝桥水。\n浔阳近四千，始行七十里。\n人烦马蹄跙，劳苦已如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}